      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve got some thoughts about the use of an optional return, which seems slightly overkill for how few places actually depend on skipping a dawn context type. But if my thoughts don\u0027t work or you\u0027re opposed, it\u0027s also not a big deal since it\u0027s just test code.",
